# Test: `show ospf route fast-reroute` rendering.
#
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-ext-6 -- FastRerouteSnapshot surfaces each primary
# next-hop with its backup next-hop, protection class (node/link/downstream), and
# TI-LFA repair label stack, while the base `show ospf route` output is unchanged;
# a backup-only change re-installs via routeEqual/DiffRoutes.
# PREVENTS: the CLI not surfacing the backup, or the base route view regressing.
#
# End-to-end CLI over SSH is exercised by the ospf-lfa-frr interop scenario.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf/spf -run 'Test(RouteEntryBackupSnapshot|BackupOnlyChangeReinstalls|FastRerouteConfigEnablesLFAPass)$' -count=1:timeout=30s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=TestRouteEntryBackupSnapshot
expect=stdout:contains=TestBackupOnlyChangeReinstalls
expect=stdout:contains=TestFastRerouteConfigEnablesLFAPass
